  "description": "Single and two storey rear extensions; alterations and extension to roof to form end gable; rear dormer; two rooflights in front roof slope; new window to side; external alterations",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The\r\nproposed first floor rear extension&amp;nbsp;would result in an inappropriate roof\r\nform that would intersect the proposed rear dormer. The proposed first floor\r\nrear extension and rear dormer, given the choice of materials and prominent\r\nlocation to the rear of the host property at first floor and roof level, would result\r\nin an unduly obtrusive and incongruous addition to the original dwellinghouse,\r\nfailing&amp;nbsp;to respect the character and proportions of the dwellinghouse and\r\nthe visual amenities of the locality. The proposal would therefore be contrary\r\nto the high-quality design aspiration of the National Planning Policy Framework\r\n(2024), Policies D1, D3, D4 of The London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of the Harrow’s\r\nLocal Plan (2021-2041) and the relevant provisions of the adopted Harrow\r\nSupplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
